4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9Kvdjv2EosQ7kNvwHbIXuG&_nc_oc=AdrmmlV5GSB_rD-_BrhHrFpxoKVxeJwUYnYbu-dNdvhRW6l3OX-bWzze2htSFVaGilk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5I_rFNyM5gbaRORbi1CMzCcD7tcz_CqLil_p9hbBwj1g&oe=6A0C5FD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTJpfSJx2tkQ7kNvwHAxhII&_nc_oc=AdpkrsTtGQsWlcIwCFKNBzRkVFydXWk2I4IQX4G4nlDHBhISCTFcGcpeWN6YjR2fbkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ovPzbA8ZzYMsGl-aPlfOLuwO1R9En5dd-Q2nHTskEjw&oe=6A0C64B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DJxENHrMSqUQ7kNvwH-FGjX&_nc_oc=Adq73GFRS25DxosDyRtRjqYEyvcj9zrRZv_9U78uHwNc-Q2LlSMyy8lMnEYj4WPDV5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4hnrL4bUxPsUtzxYvvzmu0vMT7w9--HQ4uCSZ2Aq6RsQ&oe=6A0C7255"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p